 "text": "Hi! How are you doing these days? There are couple of easy ways. One is to record yourself and listen, which is like having a conversation partner. Another is to find language exchange partner online. Most people are understanding, especially once they see you' trying. Just explain in your native language and they'll help you. Another trick is to have short conversation about everyday things you know well, like your morning routine. That's normal. The key is getting used to it, so practice makes it more natural. It does. After a few weeks, it feels like second language.",
